From 686c0a5e0ec75159bf64e5a22e0799f39debfafb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:51:28 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: New Game boots straight into the Battle Arena

In the file screen's New Game branch, the hook calls ArenaBoot_NewGame
(scene/arena_boot.c): Garet, Mia and Ivan join, all four are level 30, the
party has 1500 coins, FLAG_IN_BATTLE_ARENA is set and the game goes to
SceneId_BattleArena. No prologue, no save file read or written. Switch:
ARENA_BOOT. The new object is a row in objects.tsv and the overlay's import
list gains Unit_LevelUpTo and Unit_Calculate.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 games/tbs/objects.tsv                    |  1 +
 games/tbs/src/scene/arena_boot.c         | 81 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 games/tbs/src/scene/file_screen.c        |  8 +++
 games/tbs/src/scene/import/file_screen.s |  2 +
 4 files changed, 92 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 games/tbs/src/scene/arena_boot.c

